  "bodyHash": "94f9ca86fdb4aec1",
  "content": "\n\n<p>一款針對&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/waila\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waila</a> 或 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hwyla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hwyla</a> 的用戶端附加模組，可顯示您正查看之方塊的採集相關資訊。</p>\n<p>預設情況下，它會顯示您目前是否能採集該方塊、該方塊所需的採集等級，以及對該方塊有效的工具類型。此外，在 Waila 模組設定畫面中還有許多設定選項，可微調以精確顯示您想要的內容。</p>\n<p><em>注意：此模組主要設計用於搭配 <a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/1659892-\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers' Construct</a>，但即使沒有安裝該模組，此資訊仍然適用。</em></p>\n<p>本模組的構想由 <a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/user/151461-draxiswuf/\" rel=\"nofollow\">DraxisWuf</a> 提出。</p>\n<p><br>若需在 Fabric 平台上使用類似功能，請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/can-i-mine-this-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">Can I Mine This Block?</a> 模組。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:184.6%\"><strong>需求</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/waila\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waila</a> 或 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hwyla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hwyla</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:184.6%\"><strong>截圖</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:138.5%\"><strong>手持鐵鎬時（預設設定）：</strong></span> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Wrq7Muv.png\" alt=\"http://i.imgur.com/Wrq7Muv.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>精準採集與剪切判定：<br></strong><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PYxlfth.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"366\" height=\"82\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:138.5%\"><strong>Waila 設定畫面：</strong></span>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/I1pj6fE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1094\" height=\"621\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:138.5%\"><strong>精簡模式：</strong></span><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/zd9s0qr.png\" alt=\"http://i.imgur.com/zd9s0qr.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:184.6%\"><strong>其他資訊</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:138.5%\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/squeek502/WailaHarvestability\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 原始碼</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:138.5%\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/squeek502/WailaHarvestability/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">錯誤回報與問題追蹤</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>歡迎將此模組加入任何您想要的整合包中。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
